      "text": "FDA's records show ibutilide fumarate is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the earlier shortage first posted on 2022-04-29 is resolved.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for the marketed presentation names Pharmacia & Upjohn Company LLC (FEI 1810189) as the registered plant for analysis, API manufacture, labeling, manufacture, and pack.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected that plant most recently in inspection 1208260, which ended on 2023-06-16 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2024-09-10.",
      "cites": ["E10", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA inspection at that plant was classified OAI, and no FDA action at a registered plant occurred before the 2022-04-29 shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 54 vials of the 0.1 mg/mL 10 mL presentation with 11.9 days on hand at 4.5 vials per day; Corvale Lakeside holds 12 vials with 12.3 days on hand at 1 vial per day.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Heritage Pharmaceuticals Inc. d/b/a Avet Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
